raw/*.bin

# Narration IS committed. It used to be ignored, when every clip was a
# placeholder made with the laptop's own voice. It is now the real thing, and
# rebuilding it needs a 6 GB voice engine that takes hours to download — not
# something to ask of whoever next clones this repo.

*.webp
# Screenshots taken while checking scenes by eye. Not content.
.playwright-mcp/

# Narration engine: a Python venv and ~6 GB of open voice models. Rebuilt by tools/tts/setup.sh.
.tts/

# Secrets (the Sketchfab token). Never committed.
.env
.env.*
